803
00:53:04,601 --> 00:53:07,641
in such a way as

804
00:53:07,641 --> 00:53:10,682
to devote total attention to that.

805
00:53:10,682 --> 00:53:14,282
Sanity is taken for insanity.

806
00:53:14,282 --> 00:53:16,001
A. So my reply to

807
00:53:16,001 --> 00:53:17,721
him was simply, well, that's right,

808
00:53:17,721 --> 00:53:19,082
and we might as well face it,

809
00:53:19,082 --> 00:53:22,122
and I don't intend to do anything about that.

810
00:53:22,122 --> 00:53:23,602
But it didn't help the

811
00:53:23,602 --> 00:53:25,082
situation in terms of the interrelationship.

812
00:53:25,082 --> 00:53:27,642
K. The question is then, in education,

813
00:53:27,642 --> 00:53:32,762
can a teacher, educator, observe his hurts,

814
00:53:32,762 --> 00:53:34,442
become aware of them,

815
00:53:34,442 --> 00:53:39,562
and in his relationship with the student,

816
00:53:39,562 --> 00:53:43,642
resolve his hurt and the student's hurt?

817
00:53:43,642 --> 00:53:45,241
That's one problem.

818
00:53:45,241 --> 00:53:48,442
It is possible if the teacher is really,

819
00:53:48,442 --> 00:53:52,922
in the deep sense of the word, educator.

820
00:53:52,922 --> 00:53:56,601
That is to cultivate.

821
00:53:58,202 --> 00:54:01,241
And the next question, sir, from that arises,

822
00:54:01,241 --> 00:54:07,802
is the mind capable of not being hurt,

823
00:54:07,802 --> 00:54:11,082
knowing it has been hurt? You follow?

824
00:54:11,082 --> 00:54:15,402
Not add more hurts.

825
00:54:16,682 --> 00:54:18,442
These are two problems.

826
00:54:18,442 --> 00:54:23,721
One, being hurt, that's the past,

827
00:54:23,721 --> 00:54:27,082
and never to be hurt again.

828
00:54:27,082 --> 00:54:29,562
Which doesn't mean I build a wall of resistance

829
00:54:29,562 --> 00:54:32,442
that I withdraw, that I go off into a monastery,

830
00:54:32,442 --> 00:54:34,762
or I become a drug addict,

831
00:54:34,762 --> 00:54:37,082
or some silly things like that,

832
00:54:37,082 --> 00:54:41,162
but no hurt. Is that possible?

833
00:54:41,162 --> 00:54:43,402
You see the two questions?

834
00:54:43,402 --> 00:54:46,922
Now, if...

835
00:54:47,881 --> 00:54:52,682
That is, what is hurt?

836
00:54:52,682 --> 00:54:56,282
What is the thing that is hurt?

837
00:54:56,282 --> 00:54:59,481
You follow?

838
00:54:59,481 --> 00:55:01,801
We said the physical hurt is

839
00:55:01,801 --> 00:55:04,121
not the same as psychological hurt.

840
00:55:04,121 --> 00:55:06,361
So we are dealing with psychological hurt.

841
00:55:06,362 --> 00:55:11,962
What is the thing that is hurt?

842
00:55:11,962 --> 00:55:14,522
The psyche?

843
00:55:14,522 --> 00:55:19,482
The image which I have about myself?

844
00:55:19,482 --> 00:55:21,722
A. It is an investment that I have in it.

845
00:55:21,722 --> 00:55:25,722
K. Yes. It is my investment in myself.

846
00:55:25,722 --> 00:55:29,802
A. Yes. I have divided myself off from myself.

847
00:55:29,802 --> 00:55:30,922
K. Yes, in myself.

848
00:55:30,922 --> 00:55:35,562
That means, why should I invest in myself?

849
00:55:35,562 --> 00:55:38,601
What is myself?

850
00:55:38,601 --> 00:55:40,282
You follow? A. Yes, I do.

851
00:55:40,282 --> 00:55:45,162
K. In which I have to invest something.

852
00:55:45,162 --> 00:55:46,682
What is myself?

853
00:55:46,682 --> 00:55:50,202
All the words, the names, the qualities, the education,

854
00:55:50,202 --> 00:55:55,961
the bank account, the furniture, the house, the herds,

855
00:55:55,961 --> 00:56:00,121
all that is me.

856
00:56:00,121 --> 00:56:01,481
A. In an attempt to

857
00:56:01,481 --> 00:56:02,841
answer the question, what is myself,

858
00:56:02,842 --> 00:56:05,402
I immediately must resort to all this stuff.

859
00:56:05,402 --> 00:56:07,002
K. Obviously.

860
00:56:07,002 --> 00:56:08,522
A. There is no other way.

861
00:56:08,522 --> 00:56:10,522
And then I haven't got it.

862
00:56:10,522 --> 00:56:13,802
Then I praise myself, because I must be so marvellous

863
00:56:13,802 --> 00:56:17,082
as somehow to slip out.

864
00:56:17,082 --> 00:56:20,602
I see what you mean.

865
00:56:20,602 --> 00:56:24,362
I was thinking just a moment back,

866
00:56:24,362 --> 00:56:28,122
when you were saying it is possible for the teacher

867
00:56:28,122 --> 00:56:32,122
to come into relationship with the student,

868
00:56:32,122 --> 00:56:34,722
so that a work of healing,

869
00:56:34,722 --> 00:56:37,322
or an act of healing happens.

870
00:56:37,322 --> 00:56:38,482
K. This is what I would

871
00:56:38,482 --> 00:56:39,642
do if I was in a class.

872
00:56:39,642 --> 00:56:41,442
That is the first thing I

873
00:56:41,442 --> 00:56:43,242
would begin with, not some subject.

874
00:56:43,242 --> 00:56:46,202
I say, look, you are hurt and I am hurt.

875
00:56:46,202 --> 00:56:47,562
We are both of us hurt.

876
00:56:47,562 --> 00:56:51,002
And to point out what hurt does,

877
00:56:51,002 --> 00:56:54,362
how it kills people, how it destroys people,

878
00:56:54,362 --> 00:56:55,682
out of that there is violence,

879
00:56:55,682 --> 00:56:57,002
out of that there is brutality,

880
00:56:57,002 --> 00:56:59,562
out of that I want to hurt people.

881
00:56:59,562 --> 00:57:01,482
You follow? All that comes in.

882
00:57:01,482 --> 00:57:05,962
I would spend ten minutes talking about that,

883
00:57:05,962 --> 00:57:10,442
every day in different ways,

884
00:57:10,442 --> 00:57:13,642
till both of us see it.

885
00:57:13,642 --> 00:57:17,402
Then as an educator I will use the right word

886
00:57:17,402 --> 00:57:19,722
and the student will use the right word.

887
00:57:19,722 --> 00:57:21,642
There will be no gesture, there will be no...

888
00:57:21,642 --> 00:57:27,082
We are both involved in it.

889
00:57:27,082 --> 00:57:28,282
But we don't do that.

890
00:57:28,282 --> 00:57:29,962
The moment we come into the class,

891
00:57:29,962 --> 00:57:34,842
we pick up a book and then it goes off.

892
00:57:34,842 --> 00:57:37,082
If I was an educator,

893
00:57:37,082 --> 00:57:40,282
whether with the older people or with the younger people,

894
00:57:40,282 --> 00:57:45,002
I would establish this relationship.

895
00:57:45,002 --> 00:57:47,962
That is my duty, that is

896
00:57:47,962 --> 00:57:50,922
my job, that is my function.

897
00:57:50,922 --> 00:57:58,682
Not just to transmit some information.

898
00:57:58,682 --> 00:58:04,522
A. Yes, that's really very profound.

899
00:58:04,522 --> 00:58:08,442
I think one of the reasons that

900
00:58:08,442 --> 00:58:12,282
what you have said is so difficult

901
00:58:12,282 --> 00:58:17,082
for an educator reared within the whole academic...

902
00:58:17,082 --> 00:58:20,842
K. Yes, because we are so vain.

903
00:58:20,842 --> 00:58:21,882
A. Exactly.

904
00:58:21,882 --> 00:58:24,282
We want not only to hear that it's possible

905
00:58:24,282 --> 00:58:26,282
for this transformation to take place,

906
00:58:26,282 --> 00:58:31,642
but we want it to be regarded as demonstrably proved,

907
00:58:31,642 --> 00:58:34,122
and therefore not merely possible,

908
00:58:34,122 --> 00:58:35,802
but predictably certain.

909
00:58:35,802 --> 00:58:36,442
K. Certain, yes.

910
00:58:36,442 --> 00:58:37,322
A. And then we are

911
00:58:37,322 --> 00:58:38,202
back into the whole thing again.

912
00:58:38,202 --> 00:58:39,282
K. Of course, then we are

913
00:58:39,282 --> 00:58:40,362
back into the old rotten stuff.

914
00:58:40,362 --> 00:58:40,922
Quite right.

915
00:58:40,922 --> 00:58:43,762
A. Next time, could we take

916
00:58:43,762 --> 00:58:46,602
up the relationship of love to this?

917
00:58:46,602 --> 00:58:47,162
K. Yes.

918
00:58:47,162 --> 00:58:50,122
A. I would very much enjoy that.

919
00:58:50,122 --> 00:58:52,042
And it would seem to me...

920
00:58:52,042 --> 00:58:53,401
K. We would all come together.

921
00:58:53,401 --> 00:58:55,882
A. ...we would come together, in the gathering together.

922
00:58:56,362 --> 00:58:57,562
K. Yes, I believe that.

923
00:58:57,562 --> 00:59:05,562
This program...

